[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     91[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   every decimal and hexadecimal form, all `inf`/`nan` spellings and their partial
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     92[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   prefixes, subnormal and overflow/underflow boundaries, `%.4f` tie cases, raw
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     93[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   non-UTF-8 and embedded-NUL input, inputs up to 20 000 bytes, a
